    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "What is 710 Dab Day? – The Origins & History of 710 Dab Day"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>While <b>4/20</b> has long been the iconic holiday for cannabis culture, a newer celebration has emerged in the world of <b>concentrate enthusiasts</b>: <b>710 Dab Day</b>. Unlike 4/20’s broader focus on all things cannabis, <b>710 zeroes in on oils, waxes, and extracts</b> — the potent, flavorful side of the plant that’s gained massive popularity in the legal cannabis market over the last decade.</p><p>The term <b>“710” began circulating in underground cannabis communities around 2010</b>, primarily online. When flipped upside down, 710 spells “OIL,” a clever visual pun that became a sort of code word for concentrate lovers. It started showing up on dabbing forums, T-shirts, and Instagram hashtags — and as more people began experimenting with <b>dabbing</b> and <b>vape technology</b>, 710 took on a cultural life of its own.</p><p>The holiday began to gain traction in <b>West Coast cannabis circles</b>, especially in states like California and Colorado, where early legalization efforts gave birth to a booming concentrate market. Events began popping up in July each year — from <b>dab bars at dispensaries</b> to full-on <b>oil-focused festivals</b>. By the mid-2010s, brands, extract artists, and dispensaries began embracing <b>July 10th</b> as the official <b>Dab Day</b>, offering specials, product drops, and terpene-rich celebrations.</p><p>Today, <b>710 is widely recognized across the U.S.</b> as a day to honor the art and science behind cannabis extraction. From <b>solventless rosin to live resin, THCA diamonds to vape carts</b>, the holiday showcases innovation, potency, and flavor — and gives both seasoned dabbers and curious newcomers a reason to explore the evolving world of cannabis concentrates.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "What Exactly Are Dabs?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>“Dabbing” refers to the method of consuming cannabis concentrates by <b>vaporizing them on a hot surface</b> — typically using a dab rig or specialized vaporizer. Dabs are known for their <b>fast-acting, hard-hitting effects</b>, making them a favorite among experienced users or medical patients who need high THC levels quickly.</p><p><img src=\"assets/source/1764a749-Concentrates-1-1024x377.png\" alt=\"Concentrates\" width=\"1024\" height=\"377\" title=\"What is 710 Dab Day?\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Concentrates-1-1024x377.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/7338b502-Concentrates-1.png\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/source/9893e067-Concentrates-2-1024x411.png\" alt=\"Concentrates\" width=\"1024\" height=\"411\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Concentrates-2-1024x411.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/25e60b2a-Concentrates-2.png\"></p><p><img src=\"assets/source/5b5a31c9-Concentrates-3-1024x358.png\" alt=\"Concentrates\" width=\"1024\" height=\"358\" title=\"Cape Cod Cannabis Recreational Dispensary in Wellfleet, MA\" data-source-url=\"https://b2702268.assetcdn.net/2.0/2702268/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/Concentrates-3-1024x358.png?lossy=2&amp;strip=0&amp;webp=1\" data-master=\"assets/source/842e4f46-Concentrates-3.png\"></p><p>Common types of dabs include:</p><ul><li><p><a href=\"/categories/concentrates/shatter-2/\"><b>Shatter</b></a> – a glass-like extract that snaps apart</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/concentrates/wax/\"><b>Wax</b></a> or <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/budder/\"><b>Budder</b></a> – soft, whipped textures for easy scooping</p></li><li><p><b>Live Resin</b> – rich in terpenes and full-spectrum flavor</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/concentrates/rosin/\" data-link=\"dead\"><b>Rosin</b></a> – solventless, clean, and mechanically extracted</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/cartridges/\"><b>Vape Carts</b></a> – convenient, discreet, and oil-based</p></li></ul><p>At Cape Cod Cannabis, we carry <em>(and re-stock)</em> all of the above — from trusted Massachusetts brands — and our staff is happy to help you learn which type is best for your lifestyle and experience level.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "When Is 710 Celebrated?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><b>July 10th</b> is the official date — hence “7/10.” Much like 4/20, 710 has evolved into a <b>national cannabis celebration</b>, but its focus is on the more refined, high-powered world of oils, resins, and vaporizable products.</p><p>In many legal cannabis markets, 710 is now associated with:</p><ul><li><p>In-store events and vendor pop-ups</p></li><li><p>Big discounts on dabs and carts</p></li><li><p>Giveaways and swag for concentrate fans</p></li><li><p>Educational demos on tools like e-rigs and dab pens</p></li></ul><p>It’s the one day of the year you can geek out about terpenes, flash extraction, and THC percentages — and no one will judge you.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "Why Celebrate 710 on Cape Cod?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Summer is the perfect time to explore Cape Cod, and <b>Cape Cod Cannabis</b> in <b>Wellfleet</b> is the go-to destination for your 710 shopping. Located right on <b>Route 6</b>, we’re easy to find, friendly to locals and tourists, and fully stocked with:</p><ul><li><p>Premium <a href=\"/categories/concentrates/\">concentrates</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/vaporizers/cartridges/\">Vape carts</a> from top Massachusetts brands</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/categories/accessories/dab-tools/\">Dab tools</a>, <a href=\"/?s=dab+rig\">rigs</a>, and <a href=\"/categories/accessories/\">accessories</a></p></li></ul><p>Whether you’re stopping by after the beach or making a special trip, our expert budtenders will guide you to the perfect product — no matter your tolerance or preference.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 3,
     "text": "What to Expect at Cape Cod Cannabis on 710?"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>We’re turning up the heat this <b>July 10th</b> with <b>Dab Day-only deals</b> you won’t want to miss at Cape Cod Cannabis in Wellfleet. You can preview the lineup on our <a href=\"/specials/\">Specials page as the day gets closer. Yet, you can always check out our Bundles &amp; Blazing Bargains all year-round.</a></p>"
    }
   ]
  },
